#! case: giving a Playbook must fill every Role it declares
#! rule: R1503

EVENT food_served, insult_heard
ACTION complain

PLAYBOOK Chatting:
    ROLE partner.
    WHEN insult_heard FROM partner: DO complain.

PLOT Banquet:
    ROLE Host.
    ROLE Guest.
    PHASE reception INITIAL.

    DURING reception:
        WHEN food_served:
            ASSIGN Chatting TO Guest.    #! error R1503
